{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>黃大仙下邨一日發生兩宗火警。今日（15日）晚上6時許，警方接獲多宗報案，指黃大仙下村龍和樓一個中層單位懷疑起火。消防員到場，出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊，大約25分鐘內將火救熄。據報涉事單位住戶煮食時起火。事件中沒有人受傷，約100人自行疏散，有救護車在場戒備。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T12:40:45.034847+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T12:23:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T12:34:41.238621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T12:34:41.238621+00:00","content_hash":"46452577aea02d7d5140daacb6fecfb79363fd0ac11ff185fbec925165310f8b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}